# Baby Tracker — Server Rules

- All API routes live in `server.ts` at root level.
- Label route groups with `// ====` section comments. Match the existing pattern.
- Port hardcoded to `3000`. Do not change.
- Dev mode: Vite middleware serves the SPA. Production: `dist/` static files.
- ID generation: `'event_' + Date.now() + '_' + Math.random().toString(36).substring(2, 9)` — no UUID library needed.
- Sleep duration: always `Math.max(1, Math.round(...))` — minimum 1 minute.
- Timezone helpers `toIsraelLocalDateStr()` and `toIsraelLocalTimeStr()` are at the top of the file — use them for any date display logic, don't reinvent.
- Never query Firestore directly from `server.ts` — always call exported functions from `server/db.ts`.

## Auth

- Session middleware with `SESSION_SECRET` from `.env`. `httpOnly` cookie, `secure` in production.
- All `/api/*` routes after the login handler are gated by `req.session.parentType`.
- `activeParent` / `loggedBy` always come from `req.session.parentType` — never trust the request body for identity.
- `POST /api/login` validates against `PARENT_A_*` / `PARENT_B_*` env vars via `bcryptjs.compare()`.
- `POST /api/logout` destroys session and clears cookie.

## API Shape Reference

Routes follow REST conventions. Error response: `{ error: 'message' }` with correct HTTP status. Success: JSON body.

| Method | Path | Notes |
|--------|------|-------|
| `GET` | `/api/settings` | Returns UserSettings + `currentParent` |
| `PUT` | `/api/settings` | Partial merge |
| `GET` | `/api/events` | `?limit=N&cursor=offset&type=EVENTTYPE` |
| `POST` | `/api/events` | Create event |
| `PUT` | `/api/events/:id` | Update event |
| `DELETE` | `/api/events/:id` | Soft-delete (sets `deletedAt`) |
| `GET` | `/api/sleep/open` | Current open session or `null` |
| `POST` | `/api/sleep/toggle` | Toggle sleep state |
| `GET` | `/api/stats/*` | `?from=ISO&to=ISO` (nutrition, sleep, diapers, weight) |
| `GET` | `/api/export/xlsx` | `?from=DATE&to=DATE` binary download |
